<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:20:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>莫迪对印度公司的批评使投资疲软成为焦点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus</link><description>总理纳伦德拉·莫迪上周对印度企业的尖锐批评暴露了经济蓬勃发展的潜在弱点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus'&gt;莫迪对印度公司的批评使投资疲软成为焦点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Modi’s Criticism of India Inc. Puts Weak Investment in Focus&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度航空有限公司希望本财年削减 600 亿卢比（6.5 亿美元）的成本，其新任首席执行官概述了振兴塔塔集团旗下航空公司的举措，该航空公司在截至 3 月份的财年中出现了创纪录的亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year'&gt;印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Air India Chief Seeks to Cut $650 Million in Costs This Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</link><description>受数据中心相关支出的推动，澳大利亚商业投资出现了自截至 9 月份采矿业繁荣顶峰以来的最大涨幅，这为原本降温的经济带来了亮点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers'&gt;澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Capex Surges by Most Since Mining Boom on Data Centers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:01:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</link><description>据知情人士透露，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦已向布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮试探加入其第四届政府，此举可能有助于缓解投资者对巴西不断恶化的财政前景的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government'&gt;卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Sounds Out Bradesco’s Luiz Trabuco to Join His Government&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:07:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>